+ * Stained Glass OS (wine-sg 6510): the WinRT synthesizer speaks through a SAPI voice
+ * engine (ISpTTSEngine, msttsengine's eSpeak NG voice, 6508) and its own engine site, which keeps
+ * the audio and the word/sentence boundaries. Apart from synthesizer.c: sapi.h and the WinRT
+ * speech headers name the same interfaces.
+ *
